    },
    {
      "id": "c575a23c4237b16d310ec9f93d85bd008bf149ef",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2324356261,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Right, 12.1 is where it was introduced, but I reckon gcc reduced their false positives at some point, but determining exactly the correct version numbers would take some testing. Probably doesn't hurt to include this one as well for now, and maybe we'll fix the whole batch later.",
